  "_comment": [
    "The exact FFmpeg build the Linux AppImage bundles: the same FFmpeg commit",
    "and BtbN release as the Windows pin in ffmpeg-build.json, linux64 gpl 7.1",
    "variant. fetch-ffmpeg.sh and verify_ffmpeg_linux.py refuse anything whose",
    "size or SHA-256 differ, and build-appimage.sh and the spec check the pair",
    "again before bundling, so THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md cannot drift from the binary.",
    "",
    "The GitHub release is not immutable (the API reports immutable: false), so",
    "the archive hash is the byte identity and the build-system commit is pinned",
    "separately rather than trusted through the tag name."
